# Every text file is LF on every checkout, including a checkout on Windows.
# Git for Windows writes CRLF by default. See dbmeta D89 and D110.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The data and the images of the survey are generated. docs/survey/README.md
# says how. A diff of them is noise, so git shows none.
docs/survey/data.js linguist-generated -diff
docs/survey/static/** linguist-generated -diff
*.ttf binary
